1. A pre-migration inline Node assertion received undefined shell variables because they were assigned but not exported. It failed before database initialization. The already-authoritative safe-target-preflight.mjs had passed the same exact configuration-only target/absence assertions. The explicit Prisma command then initialized only the printed disposable target and passed.
2. A first secrets:import attempt piped through tee was noninteractive and exited with IMPORT_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED before vault mutation. The replacement direct PTY run presented the exact disposable target, received explicit IMPORT, and configured nine identifiers. The postcheck reports READY / SKIP_CONFIGURED 9. No secret values are recorded.
